 - New **Movies category** (bik, nif, dds) for **Victories**, **Wonders**, **Projects**, **Religions**, (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5511+) **Corporations**, and **Eras**, additional **audio support for non-bik** files (e.g. Religions have a nif + separate audio asset). **Play button** added in related Sevopedia categories to redirect to their entry in Sevopedia Movies. See [Sevopedia reworks (Movies (with audio support))](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Sevopedia_Reworks.md#example-091-movies-category-with-audio-support).
 - New **Music category**: allows to play **~1750 audio scripts** (i.e. files) in Sevopedia, notably for **Techs**, **Leaders**, **Eras**, **Civilizations**, and many other. **Play button** added in related Sevopedia categories to redirect to Sevopedia Music. Approach broadly similar to that of Sevopedia Movies. **Search bar support** and **widening** allows to find desired tracks. Note: there are **multiple sounds in an item** for each civilization sound item, so **replay many times the same item to hear all civilization sounds**. See [Sevopedia reworks (Music)](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Sevopedia_Reworks.md#example-092-music-category-1750-audio-scripts-playable-in-sevopedia).
 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5673+) New **Expanded Text Panels** so History/Background **text** (e.g. of the Viking unit that is long and requires scrolling to be seen or of the Great General Unit (that includes uniquenames that require scrolling to be scanned quickly)) easier to read, with **EXPAND** and **CLOSE** buttons. It occupies the whole item's page but **preserves the rest of the sevopedia page display** (footer, header, item bar and category bar) for easy browsing. This allows to **browse other category items** (e.g., other leaders from sevopedia leader's item bar) **without having to close and reopen expanded view** everytime item is changed (e.g. when clicking on another leader). Added as an optional helper shared accross all eligible categories (main code in [_sevopedia_helpers.py](/Assets/Python/Contrib/Sevopedia/_sevopedia_helpers.py)). See [Sevopedia reworks (Expanded text panel)](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Sevopedia_Reworks.md#example-093-expanded-text-panel-with-expand-and-close-buttons).
-- (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5674+) New **Expanded Content (Non-text; e.g. Animation) Panels** similarly so **animations** (e.g. of the Viking unit) can be viewed **maximized** (i.e. using all the item's page), with **EXPAND**, **RELOAD** (so e.g. the animation can be **reloaded** (e.g., to change unit color, reset animation, reset camera position/auto-rotation movement) **without having to exit and reopen expanded view**), and **CLOSE** buttons. Applied for eligible categories: Bonuses, Improvements, Units ("Un.List"), Buildings ("Buildings", "N.Wond.", "W.Wond"). See [Sevopedia reworks (Expanded Content (Non-text; e.g., Animation) Panels)](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Sevopedia_Reworks.md#example-094-expanded-content-non-text-eg-animation-panel-with-expand-and-close-buttons).
+- (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5674+) New **Expanded Content (Non-text; e.g. Animation) Panels** similarly so **animations** (e.g. of the Viking unit) can be viewed **maximized** (i.e. using all the item's page), with **EXPAND**, **RELOAD** (so e.g. the animation can be **reloaded** (e.g., to change unit color, reset animation, reset camera position/auto-rotation movement) **without having to exit and reopen expanded view**), and **CLOSE** buttons. Applied for eligible categories: Bonuses, Improvements, Units, Buildings ("Buildings", "N.Wond.", "W.Wond"). See [Sevopedia reworks (Expanded Content (Non-text; e.g., Animation) Panels)](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Sevopedia_Reworks.md#example-094-expanded-content-non-text-eg-animation-panel-with-expand-and-close-buttons).
 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5677+) New **Expanded leaderhead panel** similarly with **EXPAND** and **CLOSE** button, and **leaderhead animation** with **expanded height and scaling width** (percentage of height **to maximize display of the full leaderhead** (because a suboptimal width/height ratio causes animation to show less of the leaderhead)), and leaderhead **attitude**, **action**, and (if set) **leaderhead art era buttons** synchronized with the ones in sevopedia leader. See [Sevopedia reworks (Expanded leaderhead panel)](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Sevopedia_Reworks.md#example-095-expanded-leaderhead-panel).
 - Added a new **Sevopedia Builds** category (e.g. **"Remove Jungle"**, **Chop Down a Forest**, **"Build a Road"**, **"Create a Farm"**) distinct from Sevopedia Improvements, notably with **FeatureStruct** panels and **mod-agnostic new Civilopedia blurbs-based Background panel** (added the new XML field `Civilopedia`> to BuildInfos). Also added them to **Sevopedia Index** as **clickable entries with buttons**. See [Sevopedia reworks (Builds)](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Sevopedia_Reworks.md#example-040-builds-category-eg-remove-jungle-build-road-create-a-farm).
 - Sevopedia — Improvements: Added a new sortable **Improvement Weights (Leaders) Chart**, showing **Weights**, **Count** per Weight, and **clickable Leader buttons** for each weight and improvement.
@@ -333,7 +333,7 @@ Note: New panels added or modified mostly not mentioned here for concision. See
 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5705+) New **Event Triggers category** featuring **exhaustive XML info** about `CvEventTriggerInfo` (e.g., "Careless Apprentice") and `CvEventInfo` (e.g., event 1: "Organize a rebuilding effort; event 2: "Investigate the cause of the fire"; event 3: "We are too pressed to spare any attention to a small fire") and their detailed effects, with a **"Legend"** similarly. The implementation notably has repeated text prevention (e.g., use "x2", "x3" when bullets are the same), sevopedia links to other assets' pages (like traits in sevopedia leader), and **direct and indirect era groupings** (depending on whether the eventtrigger depends on tech's and/or prereqs directly or on related assets' related own conditions; see sevopedia legend).
